<title>UK: Jacobs to offer one for every six shares.</title>
<headline>Jacobs to offer one for every six shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipping and property firm Jacobs Holdings said on Tuesday that it would offer one new share for every six existing Jacob shares at 84 pence per share to partially finance the takeover of Ropner Plc.</p>
<p>The placing and open offer will help to raise around nine million stg, a company official said.</p>
<p>Jacobs' offer has valued Ropner's share capital at 33.7 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
